				"720p",
				"5",
				"[Scene Foundation] Real rearview mirror camera image. MIRRORED: screen-left=vehicle RIGHT, screen-right=vehicle LEFT. Daytime, stationary MPV. Preserve identity, lighting, interior.\\n[Character Registry] Person-A: ORIGINAL middle-aged male, front-passenger (screen-LEFT). Person-B: ORIGINAL girl (~4y), rear-right seat (screen-RIGHT rear). Cat-1: NEWLY GENERATED small white cat, rear-left seat (screen-RIGHT rear, behind Person-A), facing Person-B.\\n[Spatial Layout] Rearview mirror perspective (mirrored). Person-A: screen-left front. Person-B: screen-right rear. Cat-1: screen-right rear. CRITICAL: No position swap.\\n[Action Sequence] 0-1.5s: Cat-1 sits calmly on left rear seat, ears alert. Person-B turns head from window toward center, eyes locate Cat-1. 1.5-3.0s: Person-B sits upright, feet on floor, leans slightly right, right hand extends through seat gap toward Cat-1. Cat-1 remains calm, may tilt head. 3.0-5.0s: Person-B's right hand gently contacts Cat-1's head/neck, fingers stroke softly (~1Hz). Cat-1 responds: may lean into touch, eyes half-close, subtle chest movement. No sudden jumps. 5.0-6.0s: Person-B continues petting. Cat-1 relaxed, may blink slowly. Person-A observes, slight smile, no intervention. Vehicle COMPLETELY STATIONARY.\\n[Audio Visual] No dialogue. Person-B: soft smile, gentle hand motion. Cat-1: subtle head tilt, slow blink. Person-A: mouth CLOSED throughout.\\n[Environment & Vehicle] Bright daylight from side windows. Vehicle STATIONARY, no vibration.\\n[Negative Constraints] No",
